scrcpy-tray (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: system-tray launcher for scrcpy, tuned for KDE Plasma.
    Device hotplug via adb track-devices, launch presets, Wi-Fi connect,
    notifications and autostart.

